          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 148278,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir oyunda bir tuşa bastığımızda olduğu gibi, dizilerin üzerinde gezinmek ve değerlerini istediğimiz zaman değiştirmek için fonksiyonları nasıl kullanacağımızı öğrenelim.</p><p>Aşağıdaki kodu çalıştırarak bir fonksiyon kullanıp <code>3</code> değerinin <code>enemyLevels</code> dizisinde bulunup bulunmadığını kontrol et.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemyLevels = [\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" search = \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"searchEnemyLevel\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"enemyLevels, search\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt; enemyLevels.length; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (enemyLevels[i] === search) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Enemy level found!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"break\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"searchEnemyLevel(enemyLevels, search);\" /></content></code></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 148279,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Fonksiyonlar, yeniden kullanılabilir kodu çalıştırmak istediğimizde kullanışlıdır.</p><p>Dizi öğelerine <code>searchEnemyLevel</code> fonksiyonunu kullanarak erişmek için fonksiyonu çağırırken <code>enemyLevels</code> dizisini geçirelim.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"122\" endIndex=\"133\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemyLevels = [\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"searchEnemyLevel\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"enemyLevels\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(enemyLevels);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"searchEnemyLevel(enemyLevels);}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>enemyLevels</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 148280,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aynı fonksiyonu kullanarak birden çok dizide depolanan öğelere erişmek istiyorsak dizileri fonksiyonu çağırırken argüman olarak geçiririz.</p><p><code>searchEnemyLevel()</code> çağrılırken ikinci dizi olan <code>enemyLevels2</code>'yi kodlayalım.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&amp;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\":\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"210\" endIndex=\"211\" /><option startIndex=\"212\" endIndex=\"224\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemyLevels = [\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemyLevels2 = [\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"searchEnemyLevel\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"enemyLevels, enemyLevels2\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(enemyLevels);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(enemyLevels2);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"searchEnemyLevel(enemyLevels, enemyLevels2);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>,</code>, ardından <code>enemyLevels2</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 148281,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir diziyi fonksiyona geçirdikten sonra dizi öğeleri üzerinde yineleme yapabiliriz. Tüm öğeler üzerinde yineleme yapmak için bir <code>for</code> döngüsü oluştur.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemyLevels = [\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"searchEnemyLevel\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"enemyLevels\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" len = enemyLevels.length;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt; len; i++) {}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"searchEnemyLevel(enemyLevels);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"while\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"{\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"}\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"110\" endIndex=\"113\" /><option startIndex=\"114\" endIndex=\"115\" /><option startIndex=\"138\" endIndex=\"139\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>for</code>, ardından <code>(</code> ve son olarak <code>)</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 148282,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir <code>for</code> döngüsündeki her dizi öğesini almak için, <code>array[i]</code> söz dizimini kullanırız; burada <code>i</code> geçerli yinelemeyi, <code>array</code> ise dizi adını belirtir.</p><p>Tek tek <code>enemyLevels</code> öğelerini almak için kodu yazalım.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"138\" endIndex=\"152\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemyLevels = [\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"searchEnemyLevel\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"enemyLevels\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt; enemyLevels.length; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(enemyLevels[i]);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"searchEnemyLevel(enemyLevels);}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>enemyLevels[i]</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 148283,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir fonksiyon, bir dizi ve başka bir parametre kullanarak pek çok şey yapabiliriz.</p><p>Örneğin, <code>enemyLevels</code> dizisine <code>enemyLevels</code> ve ardından <code>search</code> değerlerini <code>searchEnemyLevel</code> fonksiyonuna geçirerek <code>3</code> öğesini arayalım.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&amp;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"262\" endIndex=\"273\" /><option startIndex=\"273\" endIndex=\"274\" /><option startIndex=\"275\" endIndex=\"281\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemyLevels = [\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" search = \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"searchEnemyLevel\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"enemyLevels, search\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt; enemyLevels.length; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (enemyLevels[i] === search) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Enemy level found!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"break\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"searchEnemyLevel(enemyLevels, search);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>enemyLevels</code>, ardından <code>,</code> ve son olarak <code>search</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 148284,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Belirli bir eylemi gerçekleştirmek için bir fonksiyonla birden fazla dizi de kullanabiliriz; örneğin ortak dizi öğelerini bulmak gibi.</p><p>İki diziyi <code>compareArrays</code> fonksiyonuna aktararak ortak öğeleri bulalım.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"263\" endIndex=\"271\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" one = [\" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"80\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"60\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"40\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" two = [\" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"80\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"55\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"40\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"compareArrays\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"one, two\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt; one.length; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (one[i] === two[i]) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Same value at this index:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", one[i]);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"compareArrays(one, two);}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>one, two</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
